253
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:49,657
The stranger!

254
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:50,737
Stay away!

255
00:13:50,820 --> 00:13:56,960
You have taken your first step, Marek,
on a dangerous path of ultimate darkness.

256
00:13:57,380 --> 00:14:00,460
Now you must turn back
before it's too late.

257
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:03,560
Soon the pharaoh will return. Turn back.

258
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,800
Who are you?

259
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:13,280
Seems like Marek's anger and
jealousy fed the evil inside him.

260
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,270
Lady,

261
00:14:15,353 --> 00:14:17,017
I'm supposed to feel bad for that spoiled

262
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:20,300
brat because he grew
into some evil nutcase?

263
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:25,320
Look, your brother trapped
Mai's mind in the Shadow Realm.

264
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:30,460
Now she's living out her worst nightmares,
and I'm gonna make sure he pays!

265
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:34,650
Yugi,

266
00:14:34,733 --> 00:14:39,720
it is possible to destroy the evil within
my brother without destroying the good.

267
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:43,520
I realize now that destinies
can be changed. But how?

268
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:47,197
As the Pharaoh's vessel,
you have the power to do it.

269
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,160
Attention, I'll do this again.

270
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:51,169
Lights out in two minutes.

271
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:53,250
All right.

272
00:14:53,333 --> 00:14:55,065
Time to crash in Joey's suite.

273
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,122
What you talking about, Tristan?

274
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,190
Come on.

275
00:14:58,273 --> 00:14:59,637
Your room's like a palace.

276
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:01,955
You'll never even know that I'm there.

277
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:03,080
Oh, I'll know.

278
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:04,773
I'll know by the smell.

279
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:08,560
Serenity, sweet dreams.
You too. Get some rest.

280
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:13,340
Yugi, we got a big day ahead, so
let's get us some shut-eye. Mm-hmm.

281
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:16,137
Odds are that one of us
will have to duel Marek.

282
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:18,797
And that's a butt-kicking
we'll need to be rested for.

283
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:20,420
Oh, Joey? Question.

284
00:15:20,700 --> 00:15:22,957
How do you know you and
Yugi won't be dueling each

285
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:25,757
other in the semifinals
instead of dueling Marek?

286
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,670
What?

287
00:15:26,753 --> 00:15:27,777
Watch what you say, sis.

288
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:29,095
You're gonna jinx us.

289
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:33,840
Yugi, there is one more thing
I must give to you. Huh?

290
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:39,440
It is a powerful object that I no longer
have any use for. Thanks? What is it?

291
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,797
Fate chose me to wear
the Millennium Necklace,

292
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,777
but it is time I passed
its magic to the one

293
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:51,742
who is destined to rescue
the world from despair.

294
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:56,100
You see, it no longer shows
me the future, Yugi. Take it.

295
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:59,660
I have completed my mission,
and now it is your turn.

296
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:03,317
Joey, we should head back to
the room before lights out.

297
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:04,230
Right.

298
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:06,913
See you in the morning.

299
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:10,040
Try and get some sleep.
Good night. Sweet dreams.

300
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,110
See you later.

301
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:15,280
Now I have two Millennium Miners.

302
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:18,972
I guess I'll need them both
to put an end to Marek's plan.

303
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,337
Ishizu, wait up!

304
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:27,300
I have a question for you.

305
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:30,340
If Yugi defeats the
Dark Force inside Marek,

306
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:33,481
does that mean the world
will be safe from danger?

307
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:37,680
Tell me, is there another
evil out there somewhere?

308
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:40,250
Hmm.

309
00:16:40,333 --> 00:16:41,163
I'm not sure.

310
00:16:41,246 --> 00:16:44,780
But Yugi now possesses the
power to discover these answers.

311
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,500
Good evening, Teya.

312
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:49,300
See you later, Ishizu.

313
00:16:50,460 --> 00:16:53,060
I won't be discarded that easily.

314
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:56,040
That fiend may have taken over my body,

315
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:59,440
but a portion of my spirit
remains within you, Teya.

316
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:04,500
Use the Millennium Ring to deliver
my spirit into Bakura as well.

317
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,971
Well, the Battle City Finals end tomorrow.

318
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:13,400
Yugi, you must sleep.

319
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:15,900
But I'm worried.

320
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:20,141
It's natural for you to be frightened,
but together we can do this.

321
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,297
It seems like things have
gotten so far out of hand.

322
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:26,017
Just when I think I have
Merrick all figured out,

323
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:30,218
he goes and becomes 20 times more
evil than he was in the first place.

324
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,540
We'll defeat him.

325
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:34,680
I want to believe that,
but I'm not so sure.

326
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:36,317
You saw what he did to Mai.

327
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:39,677
this guy's completely insane
and I'm the one he really

328
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:43,257
wants let me guess if we trust
in the heart of the cards

329
00:17:43,340 --> 00:17:46,797
we can beat this guy yes but
this is so much more than

330
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:50,292
just a card game and I don't
want to lose any more friends

331
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:53,100
this madness has to stop

332
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:02,857
Odeon it's time to do what I
should have done ages ago in

333
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:06,587
order for me to survive you'll
have to be sent to the shadows.

334
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:08,820
I'm afraid I'll have to step in now.

335
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,620
The spirit of the Millennium Ring.

336
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:14,960
Well, you're half right.

337
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:18,060
But I've got company with me this time.

338
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,320
The real Marek is here as well.

339
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:26,520
It appears the essence of my weaker self
has taken refuge within the body of Bakura.

340
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:28,480
I want my body back.

341
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,617
And I brought an old friend
along to help me get it.

342
00:18:31,700 --> 00:18:33,700
He promised me the Millennium Rod.

343
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:36,640
If I can successfully do away with you.

344
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:39,580
Oh, that's right.

345
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:43,417
You're the fool who's trying to
collect the Millennium Items.

346
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:45,180
If you hand over the rod,

347
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:49,880
you won't force me to add you to my
other collection, Merrick. My victims.

348
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:54,820
My Millennium Rod can easily
overpower your pitiful ring.

349
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,300
Then try me.

350
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:00,050
All right.

351
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:06,600
I told you you were no match for me.

352
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:09,940
I'll finish you off once
I take care of Oneon.

353
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:15,080
I can't move enough.

354
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,640
We're not afraid of you.

355
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:21,040
Now just hand over the object.

356
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,510
No.

357
00:19:22,593 --> 00:19:25,980
It seems to me that the
power of our items is equal.

358
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:28,777
Perhaps you'd like to
duel me for the rights

359
00:19:28,860 --> 00:19:31,700
to the Millennium Raw
if you can handle it.

360
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:33,680
Why don't we raise the stakes?

361
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:38,840
The winning duelist will
keep the millennia broad.

362
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:41,865
The loser will be banished
to the Shadow Realm.

363
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:46,020
Draw your cards and let
the Shadow Game begin.
